    "detailed_description": "&quot;Inertial Craft&quot; is a simple-to-operate racing game in a cyber world. You can experience a thrilling race with the strong and inertial behavior unique to a craft floating off the ground.<br>Enjoy unique behavior and UI for each craft.<br><br><strong>Configuration compatible with all input devices</strong><br>All operations in the game can be assigned by config.<br>Once set up, you can control all operations in the game using your favorite input device.<br><br><strong>3 classes</strong><br>There are three classes of increasing speed range: Class C, Class B, and Class A.<br>Class C is a low speed range that even those new to racing games can enjoy.<br>Class A is a high speed area that even advanced riders can enjoy.<br><br><strong>Various modes</strong><br>There are four modes: Campaign, Race, Duel, and Time Trial, each offering a different experience.<br><br><strong>Campaign</strong><br>You can earn coins by selecting a class and completing targets in the course and mode specified within the node, and proceed to the next node.<br>Coins can be used to purchase new crafts.<br><br><strong>Race</strong><br>You can compete against 7 opponent crafts.<br><br><strong>Duel</strong><br>You can play seriously against one opponent.<br>If you get ahead of your opponent, the gauge will decrease, and when it reaches 0, you can win on the spot.<br><br><strong>Time Trial</strong><br>You can run the course and measure your time with just one.<br><br><strong>4 unique crafts</strong><br>Each craft looks, behaves, and has a different UI.<br>We are also making balance adjustments for each class, and while prioritizing the time difference on the &quot;SNAKE SHAKE&quot; course to zero, we are making adjustments to preserve the individuality of each aircraft.<br><br>Original text is &quot;Japanese&quot;",
    "about_the_game": "&quot;Inertial Craft&quot; is a simple-to-operate racing game in a cyber world. You can experience a thrilling race with the strong and inertial behavior unique to a craft floating off the ground.<br>Enjoy unique behavior and UI for each craft.<br><br><strong>Configuration compatible with all input devices</strong><br>All operations in the game can be assigned by config.<br>Once set up, you can control all operations in the game using your favorite input device.<br><br><strong>3 classes</strong><br>There are three classes of increasing speed range: Class C, Class B, and Class A.<br>Class C is a low speed range that even those new to racing games can enjoy.<br>Class A is a high speed area that even advanced riders can enjoy.<br><br><strong>Various modes</strong><br>There are four modes: Campaign, Race, Duel, and Time Trial, each offering a different experience.<br><br><strong>Campaign</strong><br>You can earn coins by selecting a class and completing targets in the course and mode specified within the node, and proceed to the next node.<br>Coins can be used to purchase new crafts.<br><br><strong>Race</strong><br>You can compete against 7 opponent crafts.<br><br><strong>Duel</strong><br>You can play seriously against one opponent.<br>If you get ahead of your opponent, the gauge will decrease, and when it reaches 0, you can win on the spot.<br><br><strong>Time Trial</strong><br>You can run the course and measure your time with just one.<br><br><strong>4 unique crafts</strong><br>Each craft looks, behaves, and has a different UI.<br>We are also making balance adjustments for each class, and while prioritizing the time difference on the &quot;SNAKE SHAKE&quot; course to zero, we are making adjustments to preserve the individuality of each aircraft.<br><br>Original text is &quot;Japanese&quot;",
